  dialogueGroupName: Merchant Bob
  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 66a072aebe6d83c4cbf0fec3df23332e, type: 2}
  textLine:
  - If this takes longer than a pint. I'm busy.
  - Ah, good to see an old friend - thoughyer bariey outta diapers. What can I get
    ye?
  - Joe took my tools again. I wear, I'll bury that bastard.
  - If ye brake it, you buy it. If I break it... well, that's a traidition.
